# Negative parallelization level is rejected

A negative level is outside the supported integer range and must fail before execution.

>>> source
@config { parallelization: { level: -1 } }

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: invalid value for configuration `parallelization.level`: parallelization.level must be an integer from 0 through 100 at Span { start: 36, end: 38 }

<<< exit
1
